{"unit_id":"YJLTF__dsh-animation-studio#feature-1","repo":"YJLTF/dsh-animation-studio","commit":"9f3daba0702839f8a4002739c772f65d7039fe16","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-animation-studio 的功能「分镜编辑」：创建 spec、记分镜并逐幕编辑图层和关键帧。通过 anim_create_spec、anim_plan、anim_draft_scene 输入标题与场景数据，生成可编辑时间线。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/tools/src/register.ts:449-475","packages/tools/src/register.ts:477-508","packages/tools/src/ops.ts:100-123"]}
